 to hear that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So in the end, the last hope for the world that we did our best to find turns out to be the chuuni antics of a human friend of mine who's still wearing twin tails at the age of 27."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Er... chuuni-what? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No! This is real! Listen, I can speak with ghosts! I've always been able to! She's going to show herself today, and I'm trying to summon her true form!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Sei","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sei","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, Miss Jill, but the world outside is in chaos. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls and natives are brawling with all kinds of mechs on the streets, and a White Knight deserter, a S.F. boss, and a Griffin City Prime Minister have teamed up to save the world. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think...now isn't a good time to draw the attention of the world with your childish dreams."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm glad to have discovered your other secret. All the best with your research into the occult, honey."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait a minute. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There may be a connection between all of this. Let me ask a few more questions. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Jill, what did that ghost look like?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh...She had shoulder-length black hair and looked to be in her teens. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She wore a long black robe and her face was as stiff as a Doll's."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What was her name?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She asked me to call her Anna. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Anna Graem."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":6,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anna? Good heavens, it really is Anna!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Jill, can you still see her? That ghost?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I...I did as she instructed, and she said she would be officially guiding me today. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And then she vanished, and I've been trying to summon her... Maybe she might show up soon. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So what happened to Anna? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She said, \"if you want to learn the truth, you will have to trust me\". I don't think she's a bad person!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Er... Guys..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Miss Jill, you're 27 years old already; don't you think that sounded really dangerous?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Growing old isn't a curse, it's an achievement! It's because I'm 27 that I'm not worried about danger. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Or are you saying...it's even more dangerous than the state of this city right now?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Guys! Have...have I grown taller?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Sei","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sei","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Grown taller? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No! Good heavens, you're floating up into the air, Dorothy!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dorothy","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Dorothy","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ehhhhhh!? I-I-I-I-I'm actually flying!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Jill","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Jill","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's going on!? To think I'm not the only one witnessing a practical manifestation of the occult!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No! It's a levitation potion! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Sei, grab onto her, or else Dorothy's going to fly off!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Sei","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sei","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I got you! I got you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Stella","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_va_synthestitch","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Stella","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It was the drink... It must have been Gr G28!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages